      <div class="space-y-3 font-body text-sm text-header-foreground/55 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-2xl">
        <p>Not every young man needs this kind of mentorship, and not every situation is appropriate for this form of work. The process works best where there is at least some openness toward reflection, relationship, honesty, and gradual developmental change over time.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl text-header-foreground/75 leading-snug max-w-xl border-t border-header-foreground/10 pt-8 mb-12">
