        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3 font-body text-sm text-header-foreground/50 leading-relaxed mb-8 border-t border-header-foreground/8 pt-8">
        <p>There is no single formula that works for every young man. In some cases, mentorship creates meaningful developmental shifts. In others, different forms of support may be more appropriate. Part of working ethically is being honest about that distinction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-header-foreground/8 rounded-xl p-7 bg-void/15 mb-10 max-w-2xl">
