        <div class="space-y-3 font-body text-xs text-header-foreground/47 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Parents should not expect immediate transformation, obedience, or personality change. What this work aims to support is something slower and deeper: greater honesty, self-awareness, emotional grounding, responsibility, communication, direction, and psychological maturity developed gradually over time.</p>
          <p>In many cases, the earliest changes are perceptible rather than dramatic: more openness, less defensiveness, greater consistency, improved communication, increased self-reflection, or a renewed sense of engagement with life.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl text-header-foreground/70 leading-snug max-w-xl mb-8">
        The goal is not to create dependence on mentorship. The goal is to help a young man gradually become more capable of consciously standing within his own life.
